# AICL Example: Median Sorted
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Median

Layer:
Core

Behavior Median
    Input: array
    Output: median
    Action:
        n = len(array)
        if n == 0:
            return 0
        if n % 2 == 1:
            return array[n // 2]
        return (array[n // 2 - 1] + array[n // 2]) // 2
